    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My Bimbo Dream</strong> is a kinky visual novel about  corruption, power exchange, bimbofication and control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Randall</strong>, a broke art school dropout forced to move back in with his long-time landlady,\u00a0<strong>Sue</strong>. But everything changes when Sue decides to get breast implants\u2014and suddenly, your deepest fetish is walking around the house in a tight tank top. You\u2019ve always had a thing for her. Now, she\u2019s taking her first step toward becoming your perfect woman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you guide her further down the path\u2014toward your vision of the perfect slut?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Sexy Cast to Romance and Corrupt:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579730/extras/7bf3640335c23fa6534a650b16d04c96.poster.avif?t=1753709738\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579730/extras/7bf3640335c23fa6534a650b16d04c96.webm?t=1753709738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579730/extras/7bf3640335c23fa6534a650b16d04c96.mp4?t=1753709738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sue</strong> \u2013 The sweet landlady hiding a wild past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lucia</strong> \u2013 Her seductive, dangerously promiscuous best friend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scarlett</strong> \u2013 Your  ex, not as over you as she claims.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Megan</strong> \u2013 A cute wildcard with lots of potential.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579730/extras/78dc1d024c6390312268d9b7a660ab71.poster.avif?t=1753709738\" width=616 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579730/extras/78dc1d024c6390312268d9b7a660ab71.webm?t=1753709738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579730/extras/78dc1d024c6390312268d9b7a660ab71.mp4?t=1753709738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Features &amp; Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching paths</strong>: Pursue multiple <strong>optional</strong> kink-driven routes: <strong><i>Harem</i>, <i>Pimp</i>, </strong>or<strong> <i>NTS</i></strong>. Each with persistent consequences and distinct endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape Sue\u2019s personality, behavior, and appearance through your actions and decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-quality visuals</strong>: Thousands of hand-crafted 3D renders and hundreds of animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6\u20138 hours of gameplay per kink path</strong>: Over <strong>18+ hours total</strong> if you explore every route.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game phone with social media, text messages, Photo mode, and unlockable galleries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack and immersive sound effects.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579730/extras/76dfcacf7a98d64fca075806b519f8f2.poster.avif?t=1753709738\" width=616 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579730/extras/76dfcacf7a98d64fca075806b519f8f2.webm?t=1753709738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579730/extras/76dfcacf7a98d64fca075806b519f8f2.mp4?t=1753709738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>What NOT to Expect</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is <strong>not</strong> a sandbox or a 3D open-world game. It's a fully scripted visual novel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You <strong>won't be able to customize the characters</strong>' body types\u2014this is a curated experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no Voice Acting in game.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a vanilla romance. Expect <strong>kinks, fetishes, and power dynamics</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579730/extras/959c2ccc54e4c8279b6287aaf08a28aa.poster.avif?t=1753709738\" width=616 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579730/extras/959c2ccc54e4c8279b6287aaf08a28aa.webm?t=1753709738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579730/extras/959c2ccc54e4c8279b6287aaf08a28aa.mp4?t=1753709738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i><strong>My Bimbo Dream</strong></i> delivers <i>handcrafted degeneracy</i>, taboo kinks and twisted romance. Enjoy!</p>",
